    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to bring to the market this exceptional architecturally designed A-rated detached residence set on approximately 0.8 acres of beautifully landscaped private gardens in a highly desirable rural location just south of Ballinhassig.\r\n\r\nConstructed in 2017 and extending to approximately 2,600 sq. ft., this impressive property presents a rare opportunity to acquire a contemporary family home of excellent quality, combining generous proportions, thoughtful design and a high standard of finish throughout.\r\n\r\nThe property offers extensive and well-appointed living and bedroom accommodation, providing an ideal environment for modern family living. The carefully considered layout, quality finishes and abundance of space and natural light combine to create a home that is both elegant and highly functional.\r\n\r\nThe surrounding landscaped gardens further enhance the property, providing a private and tranquil setting while maintaining excellent accessibility to Cork City and surrounding areas. The property is conveniently located within easy reach of Kinsale and Carrigaline, with Cork Airport approximately a 10-minute drive away.\r\n\r\nThis outstanding residence offers the perfect balance of countryside living, privacy and convenience, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a substantial modern home within easy commuting distance of Cork City and its surrounding amenities.\r\n\r\nViewing of this rare opportunity comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - \r\nEntry through a composite front door, with glass side panels into a bright welcoming hallway that is beautifully tiled with large porcelain floor tiles and has a great flow through to the kitchen/ dining room via double glass doors.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining - 7.3m x 4.33m \r\nThis stunning modern kitchen/dining room has double height ceilings with extensive glazing, large rectangular picture window with terrific countryside views, porcelain tiled floor, extensive modern kitchen with integrated appliances, large centre island with integrated induction hob & splashback, large slider glazed door with roller blinds, slider door with overhead double height window. recessed lighting, glazed double doors to entrance hall, feature hanging centre lights\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.65m x 4.55m \r\nLaminate flooring, large corner window with L-shaped window seat, inserted wood burning stove, roller blinds, TV point, recessed lighting\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.42m x 2.17m \r\nPorcelain tile floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, door to rear garden, fitted units. \r\n\r\nOffice - 4.69m x 3.55m \r\nLaminate flooring, centre light. \r\n\r\nFamily Room - 4.43m x 4.41m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 2.17m x 1.27m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, floating vanity unit with large wash hand basin, large wall mirror, centre light. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nLaminate flooring, centre light. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 4.89m x 4.44m \r\nLaminate flooring, large built-in slider robe unit with mirror, centre light, walk-in wardrobe area with extensive built in shelving.\r\n\r\nEn Suite - 3.26m x 2.33m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, floating wash hand basin vanity unit, wall mirror, walk in power shower with rain shower head & chrome enclosure. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.89m x 4.56m \r\nLaminate flooring, centre light, built-in slider robe unit with mirror, roller blind.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.45m x 3.3m \r\nLaminate flooring, centre light, window roller blind.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 4.44m x 3.3m \r\nLaminate flooring, centre light, window roller blind.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, centre light, WC, floating vanity unit, large wall mirror, large free-standing bathtub, large walk in power shower unit with rain shower head & toughened glazed enclosure.  \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 242 sq metres  (2,604 sq ft)\r\nStunning private c.0.8 acre site \r\nAbundance of living and bedroom accommodation\r\nSpacious patio areas\r\nTarmacadam driveway with automated entrance gates\r\nA3 Rating (Access to Green Mortgage)\r\nMinutes to local amenities and services in Ballinhassig village\r\nShort commute to Cork Airport, Cork City Centre & Ringaskiddy\r\nShort distance to Carrigaline & Kinsale - mere 10-15 minutes"
      },
